flowchart TD
    V["Free virion"]
    Att["Attachment to receptor"]
    Entry["Genome entry"]
    Ecl["Eclipse phase"]
    Rep["Genome replication"]
    Prot["Viral protein synthesis"]
    Ass["Capsid assembly"]
    Lys["Cell lysis"]
    Rel["Virion release"]
    V -->|host range| Att
    Att -->|penetration| Entry
    Entry -->|no infectious virus| Ecl
    Ecl -->|host machinery| Rep
    Rep -->|mRNA expression| Prot
    Prot -->|structural proteins| Ass
    Ass -->|burst| Lys
    Lys -->|new virions| Rel
    Rel -->|new virions| V